":722490305,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20357,"speakerName":"阿倍良久","textMapHash":266863234,"text":"当然だ！吾はヘリオスの建造を主導し、国を挙げて、アビサルドラゴエアに抗ったのだ。","nextNodeIds":[722490306]},{"nodeId":722490306,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20357,"speakerName":"阿倍良久","textMapHash":2403314674,"text":"白夜国において、吾の他にこのような偉業を成し遂げた者はおらぬ！","nextNodeIds":[722490307]},{"nodeId":722490307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3387888970,"text":"へぇ、なんかすごそうだな。","nextNodeIds":[722490308]},{"nodeId":722490308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2705405466,"text":"でもそんなすごい人が、なんでここに閉じ込められてるんだ？","nextNodeIds":[722490309]},{"nodeId":722490309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20357,"speakerName":"阿倍良久","textMapHash":3004618802,"text":"吾は…裏切られたのだ…","nextNodeIds":[722490310]},{"nodeId":722490310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20357,"speakerName":"阿倍良久","textMapHash":2288657954,"text":"当時、天の国が底なしのアビスに落ち、人々はドラゴエアの迫害を受けた。そこで吾は、人々を救うためにヘリオスを建造した。","nextNodeIds":[722490311]},{"nodeId":722490311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20357,"speakerName":"阿倍良久","textMapHash":1667389042,"text":"だがその後、あの卑しき者たちが現れた！命の危険がなくなった途端、人々を欺くようになり…挙句の果てには、子供を一国の長にした。なんと馬鹿げたことか！","nextNodeIds":[722490312]},{"nodeId":722490312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20357,"speakerName":"阿倍良久","textMapHash":2415996994,"text":"吾もやつらの企てによって、牢獄に幽閉されたのだ。","nextNodeIds":[722490313]},{"nodeId":722490313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20357,"speakerName":"阿倍良久","textMapHash":248324858,"text":"おのれ…おのれおのれッ！","nextNodeIds":[722490314]},{"nodeId":722490314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20357,"speakerName":"阿倍良久","textMapHash":1197919962,"text":"そうだ…汝よ。","nextNodeIds":[722490315,722490317]},{"nodeId":722490315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":239814354,"text":"#{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BOYFIRST|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_GIRLFIRST]}？","nextNodeIds":[722490316]},{"nodeId":722490316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1130583322,"text":"おう、おまえのことを呼んでるみたいだぞ。","nextNodeIds":[722490320]},{"nodeId":722490320,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20357,"speakerName":"阿倍良久","textMapHash":150755370,"text":"汝のことだ！","nextNodeIds":[722490321]},{"nodeId":722490321,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20357,"speakerName":"阿倍良久","textMapHash":2479471986,"text":"ここにはかつて、吾の聖なる衣が置かれていた。しかし、長き年月を経てすでに朽ち果ててしまった。それゆえ、それを拠り所にすることはできない。","nextNodeIds":[722490322]},{"nodeId":722490322,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20357,"speakerName":"阿倍良久","textMapHash":798312978,"text":"汝が試練に通過したら、吾は自らの想いを込めた供え物を汝に託そう…","nextNodeIds":[722490323]},{"nodeId":722490323,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20357,"speakerName":"阿倍良久","textMapHash":1949355506,"text":"汝が試練を通過するのを…祈っている…","nextNodeIds":[722490324]},{"nodeId":722490324,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20357,"speakerName":"阿倍良久","textMapHash":1274947890,"text":"これは極めて危険なことだ。旅人よ、準備ができたら、吾に言ってくれ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":722490317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3007141706,"text":"いや、きっと呼んでるのはパイモン。","nextNodeIds":[722490318]},{"nodeId":722490318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3651636362,"text":"ええ、でもおまえのほうを見てるけど。","nextNodeIds":[722490319]},{"nodeId":722490319,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":480250202,"text":"（しかも熱烈な眼差しで。）","nextNodeIds":[722490320]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7224903,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGD